  "rationale": "Side A's claim concerns 1-year overall survival after curative HCC treatment (meta-analysis, OR1yr=2.62 favoring metformin), while side B's claim concerns median progression-free survival in HCC/T2DM patients treated with TACE, a non-curative modality (12 vs 7 months, P=0.0016). The outcome measures (OS vs PFS) and treatment settings (curative vs TACE) differ, so the two findings do not address a sufficiently similar outcome or contrast; notably, side A itself reports no significant OS/PFS differences after non-curative treatment, underscoring that setting matters. No material extraction error was found on either side."
